@prefix : <http://example.org/sre#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix xml: <http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@base <http://example.org/sre/user_stories> .

<http://example.org/sre/user_stories> rdf:type owl:Ontology .

### Metadata Definitions
:UserStory rdf:type owl:Class .
:title rdf:type owl:AnnotationProperty .
:description rdf:type owl:AnnotationProperty .

### User Story 1: Define SLO
:us1 rdf:type :UserStory ;
    :title "Define SLO for Payment Service" ;
    :description "As an SRE, I want to define an SLO for the Payment Service to monitor its reliability." .

### User Story 2: Define Infrastructure as Code
:us2 rdf:type :UserStory ;
    :title "Define Infrastructure as Code" ;
    :description "As a Developer, I want to use Docker Compose to define the SRE agent's environment so that it is reproducible for local development." .

### User Story 3: Define RabbitMQ Message Broker
:us3 rdf:type :UserStory ;
    :title "Define RabbitMQ with aio-pika" ;
    :description "As an Architect, I want to use aio-pika for asynchronous RabbitMQ communication, ensuring compatibility with OTel auto-instrumentation for routing key capture." .

### User Story 4: Centralized Observability with OTel Contrib
:us4 rdf:type :UserStory ;
    :title "Centralized Observability with OTel Contrib" ;
    :description "As an SRE, I want to use the otel/opentelemetry-collector-contrib image to leverage the prometheusremotewrite receiver and community processors." .

### User Story 5: Metrics and Visualization with Provisioning
:us5 rdf:type :UserStory ;
    :title "Automated Grafana Provisioning" ;
    :description "As an SRE, I want the Docker Compose setup to include automated Grafana provisioning for RabbitMQ dashboards and Prometheus data sources." .

### User Story 6: E2E Observability Validation
:us6 rdf:type :UserStory ;
    :title "E2E Playwright Regression Suite" ;
    :description "As an SRE, I want a Playwright regression suite to validate that all observability components (OTel, Jaeger, Prometheus, Grafana) are correctly integrated and showing telemetry data." .

### Test Instances for US6
:e2e_observability_suite rdf:type :RegressionSuite ;
    :title "Observability Stack Programmatic Validation" ;
    :description "Playwright suite querying Prometheus and Jaeger APIs." .

:test_prometheus_query rdf:type :E2ETestSuite ;
    :title "Prometheus API Connectivity Test" .

:test_jaeger_query rdf:type :E2ETestSuite ;
    :title "Jaeger API Connectivity Test" .

### Test Instance for SDK Version Compliance
:otel_sdk_version_compliance_fix rdf:type :SDKVersionCompliance ;
    :title "OTel SDK ResourceAttributes Migration" ;
    :description "Migrate from RESOURCE_ATTRIBUTES to ResourceAttributes for compatibility with opentelemetry-sdk 1.x." .

### User Story 8: Diagnostic Triage via Codebase Exploration
:us8 rdf:type :UserStory ;
    :title "Diagnostic Triage via Codebase Exploration" ;
    :description "As an SRE, I want the Code Agent to explore the codebase during an incident to provide triaged context and suggest priority changes based on hidden risks." .

### User Story 9: Historical Incident Retrieval via Vector DB
:us9 rdf:type :UserStory ;
    :title "Historical Incident Retrieval via Vector DB" ;
    :description "As an SRE, I want to retrieve similar historical incidents from a vector database (VoyageAI + ChromaDB) to improve incident understanding and suggested workarounds." .

### Test Instances for US8 & US9
:e2e_code_triage_test rdf:type :E2ETestSuite ;
    :title "Code Agent Diagnostic Triage Validation" ;
    :description "Playwright test validating that the Code Agent produces diagnostic spans and returns triaged context." .

### User Story 11: Architectural Interface Validation
:us11 rdf:type :UserStory ;
    :title "Architectural Interface Validation" ;
    :description "As an SRE, I want to validate that all agent components interact according to the architectural interface specification, including domain ports and standardized messaging." .

:test_architectural_interfaces_e2e rdf:type :E2ETestSuite ;
    :title "Standardized Messaging E2E Test" ;
    :description "Playwright test validating RabbitMQ messages follow the Task, Incident, and ValidationResult schemas." .

### User Story 12: Codebase Investigator E2E
:us12 rdf:type :UserStory ;
    :title "Codebase Investigator E2E" ;
    :description "As a developer, I want to verify that the Codebase Investigator correctly manages its research state and adheres to the ReAct loop constraints and recovery protocol." .

:test_code_investigator_react_loop rdf:type :E2ETestSuite ;
    :title "Codebase Investigator ReAct Loop Validation" ;
    :description "Playwright test validating the 10-turn limit and state schema compliance." .
